# Virtual copies.
variants.create = Mekem wan virtual kopi…
variants.rename = Jenisim nem blong virtual kopi…
variants.delete = Deletem virtual kopi
variants.close = Klosem foto ya mo ol virtual kopi blong hem bifo yu muvum o deletem olgeta.
variants.saved_hint = Kopi i stat long edit we yu sevem, o long orijinal sipos i no gat edit. Sevem ol jenis we oli stap fastaem.
variants.move_original = Muvum orijinal foto blong muvum ol virtual kopi blong hem.
variants.protected_export = Jusum wan narafala ples. Ol export blong Gallery oli no save putum wan niufala fael long ples blong orijinal o ples we ol edit oli stap.
